In C6-3 Districts without a letter suffix in Mandatory Inclusionary Housing Program Area 4, as of February 14, 2018, in Community District 1, in the Borough of the Bronx, for zoning lots containing qualifying affordable housing or qualifying senior housing, the floor area ratio shall be that for an R9-1 District set forth in Section 23-22 (Floor Area Regulations for R6 Through R12 Districts).In C1 or C2 Districts mapped within R9 and R10 Districts, or in Commercial Districts with a residential equivalent of an R9 or R10 District, for zoning lots containing a building that is developed or enlarged pursuant to the applicable tower regulations of paragraph (c) of Section 35-632, the provisions of Section 23-241 (Special tower provisions) shall apply:

