Q-3: Newtown Creek, in the Special Southern Hunters Point District, as set forth in Section 125-46 (Newtown Creek Waterfront Access Plan).The boundaries of the area comprising the Northern Hunters Point Waterfront Access Plan and the location of certain features mandated or permitted by the Plan are shown in Maps 3 through 5 through located in Appendix C to this Chapter. The plan area has been divided into parcels consisting of tax blocks and lots and other lands existing on November 12, 2025, as follows:

