Easement TypeHeight above Curb Level (h)Depth below Curb Level* (D)Length (L)Width(W)Zoning Lots less than 10,000 sfZoning Lots 10,000 sf or more115208020x2154010020xx315408532x4153510010x5154010010x615356520x

